                </h2>
                <div id="collapse5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        No account, no email, no password. Just open the tool, create your invoice, and download the PDF. We don't store any data.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
